    /// - Remark: Generated from `#/paths//finance/cost_totals/get(getFinanceCostTotals)`.
    func getFinanceCostTotals(_ input: Operations.GetFinanceCostTotals.Input) async throws -> Operations.GetFinanceCostTotals.Output
    /// Total the income by period for the finance viewers
    ///
    /// The income totals for the holders of `view_finance`. It takes
